<title>USA: Hudson General approves additional buy back.</title>
<headline>Hudson General approves additional buy back.</headline>
<dateline>GREAT NECK, N.Y. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hudson General Corp said Friday its directors had authorized the repurchase of up to 100,000 shares of its common stock, either on the open market or in privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>The authorization is in addition to previous approvals under which the company still may repurchase 92,700 shares, Hudsdon said in a statement.</p>
<p>Since December 1 the company has repurchased 243,000 shares on the open market, Hudson said.</p>
<p>It said it had 1,734,849 shares outstanding as of May 30.</p>
<p>Hudson provides various services at airports in the U.S. and Canada.</p>
